{
    "manifest_version": 3,
    "name": "公众号发布安全台 · Writer Guard",
    "version": "1.29.3",
    "description": "公众号小编的合规工作台：Markdown 编辑台（真机手机预览/AI 写作，未配 API 把提示词直接填进右侧内置豆包侧窗并发送；智录笔记投递只带短图代号、预览显示真图不显示 base64；隐形字数插完可继续编辑；高度自定义记忆）+ 内嵌豆包侧窗（工作台内鼠标离开自动收起；公众号编辑页右下角也有豆包按钮，点击才收起）+ 智录笔记（视频截图/封面/短剧/PPT）+ 情绪导演（脸身声词四重奏，自动复用工作台 API Key）、红线词实时拦截、AI痕迹检测、专业封面设计器（复制即高清 PNG/HTML，插入正文开头）、截图标注（滚轮放大/原创指纹/背景光/分块融合可叠加可撤销）、素材授权台账、数据复盘。",
    "minimum_chrome_version": "111",
    "permissions": [
        "storage",
        "activeTab",
        "tabs",
        "alarms",
        "clipboardWrite",
        "scripting",
        "unlimitedStorage"
    ],
    "host_permissions": [
        "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/*",
        "https://api.openai.com/*",
        "https://api.deepseek.com/*",
        "https://open.bigmodel.cn/*",
        "https://api.moonshot.cn/*",
        "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/*",
        "https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/*",
        "https://api.weixin.qq.com/*",
        "https://api4.ipify.org/*",
        "https://api.ipify.org/*",
        "https://*.doubao.com/*",
        "https://*.byteimg.com/*",
        "https://*.ibyteimg.com/*",
        "https://*.bytetos.com/*",
        "https://*.pstatp.com/*",
        "https://*.volccdn.com/*",
        "https://*.agnes-ai.com/*",
        "https://speech.platform.bing.com/*"
    ],
    "sandbox": {
        "pages": [
            "studio/zhilu.html",
            "studio/emotion.html"
        ]
    },
    "background": {
        "service_worker": "background.js"
    },
    "action": {
        "default_popup": "popup/popup.html",
        "default_title": "发布安全台"
    },
    "content_scripts": [
        {
            "matches": [
                "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/*"
            ],
            "js": [
                "content/net-hook.js"
            ],
            "run_at": "document_start",
            "world": "MAIN",
            "all_frames": true
        },
        {
            "matches": [
                "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/*"
            ],
            "js": [
                "content/data-scrape.js"
            ],
            "run_at": "document_idle",
            "all_frames": true
        },
        {
            "matches": [
                "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/*"
            ],
            "js": [
                "data/dict.js",
                "workbench/rewriter.js",
                "content/content.js"
            ],
            "css": [
                "content/content.css"
            ],
            "run_at": "document_idle",
            "all_frames": false
        },
        {
            "matches": [
                "https://www.doubao.com/*",
                "https://doubao.com/*"
            ],
            "js": [
                "content/skills-data.js",
                "content/doubao.js"
            ],
            "run_at": "document_idle",
            "all_frames": true
        }
    ],
    "options_page": "workbench/workbench.html",
    "web_accessible_resources": [
        {
            "resources": [
                "workbench/*",
                "data/*",
                "icons/*",
                "studio/*"
            ],
            "matches": [
                "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/*"
            ]
        }
    ],
    "icons": {
        "16": "icons/icon16.png",
        "48": "icons/icon48.png",
        "128": "icons/icon128.png"
    }
}